https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls/4502","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pull/4502","diff_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pull/4502.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pull/4502.patch","merged_at":"2020-05-20T19:02:20Z"},"body":"## ...> Data types > Arrays and > JSON: Semantic and technical changes. ~55 files affected.\r\n\r\nThis PR contains changes to the JSON doc and the Arrays doc undet these directories:\r\n```\r\n.../docs/content/latest/api/ysql/datatypes/type_array\r\n.../docs/content/latest/api/ysql/datatypes/type_json\r\n```\r\n### Arrays doc\r\n\r\nThere was some semantic changes.\r\n\r\n- Accounts were added for the second overloads of both `array_agg()` and `unnest()` in  the file `array-agg-unnest.md`.\r\n\r\n- Four files were changed to remove all reference to Issue #4296 and its workaround.\r\n\r\nEvery single `.md` file in the `type_array` tree is changed. But the changes are for largely techincal and minor changes.\r\n\r\n- The front matter in every file now has `isTocNested: true` and `showAsideToc: true` to harmonize with the JSON doc which already had tese settings. Before the change, these settings were botn set to `false`.\r\n- Several spelling errors were corrected.\r\n\r\n### JSON doc\r\n\r\nThere are very many file changes for techincal and minor reasons.\r\n\r\n- 33 of the previously-existing  34`.md` files are changed. For example, very many orthographic changes were made (like rendering SQL and PL/pgSQL  keywords in prose in backticked upper case form). More notably, all mentions of JSON functions and operators described in other files were searched out and links were added.\r\n- The file `code-example-conventions.md` was moved from the `functions-operators` directory to the parent `type_json` directory.\r\n\r\nThere were three semantic changes. \r\n\r\n- 3 new files were added. One, `json-literals.md`, has an account of SQL literal for JSON values. The other two, `jsonb-agg.md` and `jsonb-object-agg.md`, describe the functions `json_agg()` and `json_object_agg()`. These were missing altogether—tracked by Issue #4319.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/4502/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/4502/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]